WEBVTT

00:00:01.970 --> 00:00:04.520
We'll arrive in Japan by tomorrow night.

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:07.840
<i>Great. I'm all set here, as well.</i>

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:10.680
Mizuhara Reito's worldwide broadcast

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:19.490
UW Simultaneous World Broadcast

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:15.740
showed the world that at least one man 
with resistance to the MK Virus exists.

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:19.490
World HQ wants him in America immediately.

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:23.250
<i>Yes. That's the order the leadership gave.</i>

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:28.500
<i>But the Japan branch is 
hiding other men, as well.</i>

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:31.760
<i>Our investigation revealed that.</i>

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.430
And that's why I was brought here?

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:38.010
<i>Yes. Stay sharp upon your arrival.</i>

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:39.550
Yes, ma'am.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:44.390
So this is the messenger from UW World HQ?

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:49.660
Yes. All we know is her title 
and her name, Mansfield.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:52.010
The Peacekeeping Activities Bureau.

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:57.780
Officially, it's an organization that 
monitors potential threats to UW's leadership.

00:00:58.230 --> 00:01:03.040
<i>But the rumors say they shut down terrorists 
in Australia and Canada by force.</i>

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:07.470
Are they coming to search for Izanami, 
that terrorist organization?

00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:11.900
HQ wouldn't send a messenger just for that.

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:14.550
What are they planning?

00:01:15.020 --> 00:01:17.050
Look at this.

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:23.560
We've seen a lot of strange things happening 
around Number 2, Mizuhara Reito.

00:01:23.870 --> 00:01:29.470
What we found from Mansfield's background 
is that she is former military,

00:01:29.470 --> 00:01:31.820
and was promoted at incredible speed.

00:01:32.270 --> 00:01:37.320
<i>The one thing I hear about Miss Mansfield 
is that you don't want to mess with her.</i>

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:43.740
But with all the Numbers in our 
possession, we have the initiative.

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:46.830
Just follow the plan.

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:49.560
<i>You don't need to tell me.</i>

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:52.550
Good morning, Doi-kun.

00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:53.460
Morning.

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:54.960
Good morning.

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:55.800
Good morning.

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:01.350
<i>She's today's girl, huh?</i>

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:05.030
Good morning.

00:02:05.030 --> 00:02:06.940
Good mor—

00:02:12.530 --> 00:02:14.700
Come to my room today.

00:02:18.410 --> 00:02:19.460
What's wrong?

00:02:19.460 --> 00:02:24.240
I'm sorry. I'm on my period...

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:27.560
Okay.

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:29.290
Some other time.

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:38.630
Yes, that's right.

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:43.380
Sorry! I've got another call!

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:46.020
<i>Were you talking with someone?</i>

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:47.730
Just a personal thing.

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:48.570
<i>I see.</i>

00:02:48.570 --> 00:02:50.140
Anything going on?

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:54.900
<i>The World HQ messenger I told you 
about before is coming tomorrow.</i>

00:02:55.220 --> 00:02:57.310
They're finally here, huh?

00:02:57.310 --> 00:03:00.400
I don't really need to do 
anything special, right?

00:03:00.690 --> 00:03:01.630
<i>Correct.</i>

00:03:01.630 --> 00:03:03.780
<i>Anything to report?</i>

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:07.540
Nope! Everything's going great!

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:10.010
<i>All right. I'll end the call, then.</i>

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:17.210
Now then, who will help 
me more if I join them?

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:23.660
There, there.

00:03:26.160 --> 00:03:27.630
Jeez...

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:34.640
<i>How many times have you 
washed your mouth out today?</i>

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:36.620
It just bothers me.

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:40.240
<i>Sorry for making you do the unpleasant stuff.</i>

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:42.000
<i>Did he force himself on you?</i>

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:43.190
Nope.

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:45.130
I just waved him off.

00:03:45.130 --> 00:03:47.490
So? How are things on your end?

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:52.210
<i>Going well. UW World HQ's 
messenger is almost here.</i>

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:54.620
<i>We'll put the plan into effect soon.</i>

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:36.930
I'm so happy...

00:05:36.930 --> 00:05:40.230
It's been so long since 
you took my clothes off!

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:43.480
Now, let me do it.

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:48.240
<b>Girls' Dorm Bath</b>

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:48.240
Doing it in the girls' dorm 
bath is pretty exciting.

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:49.650
This way.

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:53.080
Wow, it's really big.

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:54.120
Welcome.

00:05:55.570 --> 00:05:57.870
Shou-chin, I'll wash you clean.

00:05:59.270 --> 00:06:00.880
Thanks.

00:06:16.220 --> 00:06:21.260
Hey, Shou-chin, I was the only one who didn't 
get to join in at the pool last time.

00:06:21.260 --> 00:06:22.780
Give me a reward.

00:06:22.780 --> 00:06:23.980
Of course.

00:06:30.650 --> 00:06:32.410
Shou-chin!

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:36.870
Shunka-san, why don't you and 
Shouta-san have fun together?

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:42.420
O-Okay. It's so slick... 
I feel like I'm going to slip!

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:45.920
<b>Girls' Dorm Bath</b>

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:48.160
This is so great.

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:52.430
Let me join in, too!

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:54.260
Yanagi-san!

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:58.560
Hey, you're with Koyu-chin's 
faction, aren't you?

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:00.430
There aren't any "factions"!

00:07:00.430 --> 00:07:03.120
And if there were, 
I'd be with my own faction!

00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:09.050
Anyway, during the swimming race, you were 
using me as a way to have fun, weren't you?

00:07:09.050 --> 00:07:10.820
I noticed!

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:16.950
Doi-chan, come on. 
Remember the taste of my body.

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:20.350
Let's all do it together, then.

00:07:22.440 --> 00:07:25.810
<i>After that, I indulged myself 
in every lustful urge.</i>

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:27.710
<i>In the library.</i>

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:29.800
<b>Nurse's Office</b>

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:32.300
<i>In the nurse's office.</i>

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:35.890
<i>In the middle of class.</i>

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:40.960
<i>Anything I wanted to do to a girl, I did.</i>

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:44.840
<i>The things holding me back 
gradually begin to break...</i>

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:56.170
Please no ghosts! Please no ghosts! 
Please no ghosts!

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:56.170
It's okay, Sui-chan!

00:07:56.170 --> 00:07:57.990
Boo!

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:01.280
This is an old hospital! There's ghosts!

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:04.330
If you scare me again I'll get really mad!

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:09.510
So we ostensibly came to 
Keimon City to visit Taniguchi-san.

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:13.510
But the Directors have 
to be watching us, right?

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:17.050
I submitted the paperwork to have 
you come here, Mizuhara-kun.

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:18.840
We got permission easily, too.

00:08:18.840 --> 00:08:20.770
It'll be fine. Probably.

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:23.270
There's no time to waste worrying about it.

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:27.140
The secrets to humanity's 
survival may be here.

00:08:28.310 --> 00:08:31.900
So anyway, what are your 
feelings towards Mira?

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:36.030
You know she's into you, right?

00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:37.900
W-Well...

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:41.650
I think she's a wonderful person.

00:08:41.650 --> 00:08:44.210
You know, I've been thinking...

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:46.040
Are you a virgin?

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:50.910
It would explain a lot, I think.

00:08:50.910 --> 00:08:52.630
So, what's the deal?

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:55.440
I'll leave it to your imagination.

00:08:55.440 --> 00:09:00.530
Oh, I thought you had an iron will, 
but you're actually just a virgin!

00:09:01.510 --> 00:09:03.430
Got it, let's go.

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:05.310
Don't just decide that...

00:09:05.530 --> 00:09:09.440
Akane-san, don't tease Reito-sama!

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:10.820
A moving corpse!

00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:15.620
Don't hurt me!

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:19.140
Go away, ghosts! Go away, ghosts! 
Go away, ghosts!

00:09:17.710 --> 00:09:19.140
I'm kidding.

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:22.080
Go away, ghosts! Go away, 
ghosts! Go away, ghosts!

00:09:19.810 --> 00:09:22.080
Are you okay, Sui-chan!

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:25.260
Reito-sama! I'm scared!

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:27.330
You scare me more than the ghosts.

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:36.840
This air duct is big enough 
for a person to fit through!

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:56.110
Welcome to Japan.

00:09:56.430 --> 00:09:59.820
Thank you for coming to 
greet me, Director Kihara.

00:10:00.650 --> 00:10:04.400
Your Japanese is very good, Ms. Mansfield.

00:10:04.400 --> 00:10:08.000
No, I'm not Ms. Mansfield.

00:10:08.640 --> 00:10:13.630
I'm her aide. She's elsewhere.

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:16.630
In a very important place to this country.

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:19.090
You know what I mean, right?

00:10:25.140 --> 00:10:27.190
It really is cramped...

00:10:27.190 --> 00:10:28.220
Yeah.

00:10:28.720 --> 00:10:30.150
What? What's wrong?

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:32.400
Did you see that?

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:34.150
No, I didn't see anything!

00:10:34.510 --> 00:10:35.750
This way!

00:10:39.340 --> 00:10:40.410
Look at that...

00:10:40.810 --> 00:10:43.280
What's a place like this 
doing beneath a hospital?

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:45.790
Huh? Is that...?

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:46.640
Let me see!

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:47.130
What?

00:10:47.130 --> 00:10:50.290
Akane-san! If you climb 
on top of me like that...

00:10:54.560 --> 00:10:55.760
Reito-sama!

00:10:55.760 --> 00:10:59.190
Oh, my. Fancy seeing you here.

00:10:59.190 --> 00:11:00.720
You're...

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:04.300
So you did find this place.

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:08.230
Kuroda, what the hell do 
you think you're doing?

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:10.410
Th-The Technical Director...

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:13.660
Wh-What is this place?

00:11:13.660 --> 00:11:16.290
Who could even say?

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:18.860
I bet you already know, don't you?

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:22.180
Are Reona and Hatsumi and 
the other girls here?

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:24.240
Is this where you made the MK Virus?

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:27.640
I always wanted to say this line...

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:32.000
"Now that you've seen this place, 
you won't leave alive!"

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:42.540
Soldiers?

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:47.510
I'm glad I made it in time.

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:49.600
Chloe-san!

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:52.690
We meet again, Mizuhara Reito-san.

00:11:53.960 --> 00:12:00.570
I'm Chloe Mansfield, 
from UW World Headquarters.

00:12:01.140 --> 00:12:04.780
You're with UW World Headquarters?

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:09.540
Yes. I had a lot of fun at 
the hot springs, though.

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:17.130
I'm in charge of the UW Department 
of Peacekeeping Operations.

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:20.380
In charge? At her age?

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:23.840
Ever since your big announcement,

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:29.710
I pretended to be an exchange student 
and investigated what's going on Japan.

00:12:29.710 --> 00:12:34.060
That included what you, 
and the five directors were up to.

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:36.230
Oh, right! We need to treat her!

00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:42.640
She attempted to delete you. 
We didn't have a choice!

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:44.960
Reito-sama!

00:12:44.960 --> 00:12:46.800
I see.

00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:49.750
This factory has a bomb inside.

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:51.670
There's no time to disarm it.

00:12:51.670 --> 00:12:52.920
Let's go!

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:54.690
Who set the bomb?

00:12:54.690 --> 00:12:57.460
Reito-sama! We need to get out!

00:12:57.460 --> 00:12:59.630
This way! This way!

00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:10.240
Get in!

00:13:10.240 --> 00:13:12.720
The car? The helicopter? Which?

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:36.960
<i>We were so close to finding 
something on the MK Virus, too!</i>

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:42.380
It's Hakuro's turn today!

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:44.290
No, it's mine!

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:46.850
And it's got nothing to do 
with you, anyway, Koyuki-san!

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:51.890
Where is Kamiya-chin when we need her?!

00:13:52.210 --> 00:13:55.360
Everyone, I have a suggestion!

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:02.150
All set. Now...

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:06.400
Okay, Shou-chin. Go ahead.

00:14:11.690 --> 00:14:14.410
Let's all do it. The four of us.

00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:23.170
Okay, everyone... now turn 
your butts toward me.

00:14:36.340 --> 00:14:38.390
The view is amazing!

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:51.540
<i>Who could've imagined this, five years ago?</i>

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:56.350
<i>They called me Dojii. They made fun of me.</i>

00:14:58.480 --> 00:15:02.220
<i>And now... I've got one 
hot girl after another.</i>

00:15:04.430 --> 00:15:08.300
<i>None of this felt real after 
I woke up from cold sleep.</i>

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:11.310
<i>But now there's no doubting it.</i>

00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:15.620
<i>This world is my paradise!</i>

00:15:16.320 --> 00:15:21.950
<i>And I'm going to enjoy 
every last second of it!</i>

00:15:24.890 --> 00:15:29.060
Orgy! Orgy! Or-Or-Orgy!

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:30.490
<b>Episode 9</b>

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:30.490
<b>Feast of Debauchery</b>

00:15:29.060 --> 00:15:32.490
This whole school exists for 
Shouta-sama to indulge himself.

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:38.350
Every girl here is just 
someone for him to snack on!

00:15:38.350 --> 00:15:41.870
So we can't have the food running away.

00:15:42.810 --> 00:15:45.630
When will you let me go back to Tokyo?

00:15:46.080 --> 00:15:51.250
Soon. Shouta-sama is breaking
 out of his shell.

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:55.890
When he does, you and 
the rest of the girls...

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:59.720
What are your intentions 
for making this insane place?!

00:15:59.720 --> 00:16:03.230
If you just want babies, there are other ways!

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:05.120
Well, of course...

00:16:09.340 --> 00:16:10.660
Mizuhara-san,

00:16:10.660 --> 00:16:16.290
there's something I've always wondered 
since you showed yourself to the world.

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:21.000
Are you really the only male 
who can survive right now?

00:16:21.300 --> 00:16:25.500
<i>Does she already know about 
Hino-san and the other men?</i>

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:31.510
Why did the Japanese directors decide to 
show you to the world without telling us?

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:34.760
And what was that strange facility?

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:36.800
Why did it explode?

00:16:37.280 --> 00:16:39.160
There's a simple answer.

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:42.520
And someone as smart as you 
has already figured it out.

00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:48.690
As you're aware, Ms. Hope, 
the Technical Director is a bit of an oddball.

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:51.530
She seemed to be doing some kind of 
mysterious research in Keimon City.

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:53.680
But we have nothing to do with it.

00:16:53.680 --> 00:16:55.360
Director Kihara.

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:57.780
I believe you knew all about it.

00:16:57.780 --> 00:17:00.910
In fact, you were the one giving 
the orders, weren't you?

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:04.700
Let me ask another question, then.

00:17:04.700 --> 00:17:08.040
There are people other than Mizuhara Reito

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:12.550
who possess resistance to 
the MK Virus, aren't there?

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:24.560
Ms. Hope, we're placing you under arrest.

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:31.360
So you've shown yourselves 
for who you really are, then.

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:39.700
Do you know who you're pointing guns at?

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:44.000
Director, we're not your personal army.

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:47.370
We work for UW.

00:17:48.710 --> 00:17:51.100
That's right!

00:17:51.100 --> 00:17:52.170
Don't tell me...

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:57.840
Director-General Shutou has been telling 
us all about what you've been up to.

00:17:57.840 --> 00:17:59.340
That's right!

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:01.840
You... traitor!

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:04.560
How scary! Don't get mad at me!

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:09.810
On behalf of Chloe Mansfield, 
the head of UW Peacekeeping Operations,

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:12.470
I'm placing you three under arrest.

00:18:12.470 --> 00:18:17.180
You're under arrest for manufacturing 
and spreading the MK Virus,

00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:19.570
for ignoring orders from UW World HQ,

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:22.170
and violating your duty 
to report your activities,

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:24.330
illegally exploiting the Japanese people...

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:27.080
The list could go on forever.

00:18:29.520 --> 00:18:34.090
It's very likely that facility 
was where the MK Virus was made.

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:37.750
D-Did they destroy it to cover their tracks?

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:40.340
It's the obvious assumption.

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:45.100
What they did is blasphemous! 
Inhuman! Truly frightening.

00:18:45.530 --> 00:18:48.750
If we knew how their MK Virus 
production process worked,

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:51.100
maybe we could've made a cure!

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:54.160
It was quite likely.

00:18:54.160 --> 00:19:00.110
But the Japanese directors were 
lying to you this whole time.

00:19:00.110 --> 00:19:04.870
They were supposed to be helping 
you make a cure, right?

00:19:05.270 --> 00:19:07.700
<i>The MK Virus was artificially created!</i>

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:13.250
<i>Erisa was put in danger when 
she investigated the MK Virus!</i>

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:19.760
And there are other unpleasant occurrences 
as a result of the Japanese director's plan.

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:24.480
Are you aware of the worldwide 
incidents of terrorism?

00:19:24.480 --> 00:19:25.140
No.

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:29.210
The huge decrease in population has 
drastically reduced human productivity,

00:19:29.210 --> 00:19:33.530
creating gaps in economic wealth 
and widespread discontent.

00:19:33.530 --> 00:19:38.650
And then everyone finds out that the only 
surviving man is completely under UW's control.

00:19:39.130 --> 00:19:44.160
When Ms. Kihara of the Japanese 
branch revealed you to the world,

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:46.810
it caused more terrorist 
acts all over the globe.

00:19:47.550 --> 00:19:50.910
You know about Erisa Tachibana, right?

00:19:51.840 --> 00:19:54.030
Look at this.

00:19:55.640 --> 00:20:01.360
She's currently with a terrorist 
group opposing UW rule.

00:20:01.360 --> 00:20:03.380
N-No...

00:20:03.870 --> 00:20:07.130
I guess there'll always 
be festivals like these.

00:20:07.130 --> 00:20:09.640
Hey, Reito! I want to try that!

00:20:10.510 --> 00:20:14.070
Look! I got a big one! It's so cute!

00:20:14.070 --> 00:20:15.150
You're right...

00:20:15.460 --> 00:20:17.400
This takoyaki's so great!

00:20:17.760 --> 00:20:18.950
Want another?

00:20:20.710 --> 00:20:22.690
Erisa? What's wrong?

00:20:22.690 --> 00:20:25.310
I feel sad for some reason...

00:20:26.210 --> 00:20:30.210
I saw something about the state of 
the world on the news the other day.

00:20:30.210 --> 00:20:32.250
When I think of the fact that

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:36.040
there are kids in regions without good 
medicine, who can't eat like this...

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:37.420
That's why you're becoming a doctor, right?

00:20:39.820 --> 00:20:44.780
You can join an NGO or work on 
a vaccine for a fatal illness.

00:20:44.780 --> 00:20:47.430
That's why you're studying 
so hard all the time.

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:51.840
So nobody will blame you 
for having some fun today.

00:20:52.990 --> 00:20:55.750
And there's seaweed in your teeth.

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:58.210
You always do this!

00:20:59.870 --> 00:21:02.460
<i>What happened, Erisa?</i>

00:21:11.970 --> 00:21:14.010
<i>Is she a little better now?</i>

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:17.670
<i>She has a cute face when 
she's like this, at least...</i>

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:26.680
U-Um...

00:21:34.670 --> 00:21:35.960
Another explosion?

00:21:36.850 --> 00:21:39.940
That's my sister's school!

00:21:40.210 --> 00:21:43.680
I just got a report from 
one of my women in Tokyo.

00:21:43.680 --> 00:21:47.370
One of the men who are 
resistant to the MK Virus,

00:21:47.370 --> 00:21:50.330
the ones the Japanese 
branch calls the Numbers,

00:21:50.720 --> 00:21:53.450
was just kidnapped by terrorists.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Episode 10</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>The Two Numbers</b>
